      "url": "https://www.wonderfair.com/contact",
      "final_url": "https://www.wonderfair.com/contact",
      "title": "Visit & Contact — WONDER FAIR",
      "text": "## Visit OUR STORE\n\nWonder Fair  \n841 Massachusetts St  \nLawrence, KS 66044\n\nHome of art supplies, stationery, prints, gifts, and lots more.\n\n## STORE Hours\n\nMonday – Saturday: 9:30AM – 8PM  \nSunday: 10AM – 6PM\n\n## Phone\n\n(785) 856-3247\n\n## VISIT SECURE ATTACHMENTS & THE UTOPIAN BOOKSTORE\n\n15 West 9th St.   \nLawrence, KS 66044\n\nSecure Attachments is proud to present the Midwest’s largest selection of staplers, clips, bands, adhesives, and folders – everything you need to Get it Together and Keep it Together. From vintage to modern, artisanal to everyday, there’s something for everyone at “the most fasten-ating store in Kansas.\" Secure Attachments was created as an ongoing collaboration with the artist Randy Regier\n\nWonder Fair’s Utopian Bookstore offers a highly curated selection of art books covering design, architecture, fine art, photography, food, and philosophy along with small press artists’ books and zines from many contemporary creators. This secret book shop (in the back of a Stapler Store!) has some of the most unique and extraordinary books you can find in-print on Planet Earth.\n\n## SECURE ATTACHMENTS Hours\n\nThursday-Saturday: 12PM-5PM  \nSunday: 12PM-4PM\n\nGeneral Inquiries  \nmeredith@wonderfair.com\n\nArtist Submissions  \nsubmissions@wonderfair.com\n\nSecure Attachments  \nprocurement@secureattachments.net",
